      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Thanks for the report!\n\nThis is actually a limitation of Unity's shader/material inspector. 2D textures have a tiling and offset value, but some shaders just don't use them.\n\nFortunately, Matlat Lit's **main** offset and tiling values work fine. It's just the matcap that can't be tiled or offset.",
